    Modify get1key() and getcmd() so that characters received but not
    yet handled are pushed back to the input buffer when a SIGWINCH
    occurs (UEM_NOCHAR seen).
    get1key() logs incoming Unicode chars for getcmd(), and
    if it sees UEM_NOCHAR it sets a flag. [input.c]
